    {
      "id": "0e1ff847ec10-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The equation where roots are reciprocal of the roots of x 2 - x - 6 = 0 is",
      "questionHtml": "<span style=\"\">The equation where roots are reciprocal of the roots of x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- x - 6 = 0 is</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "6x 2 + x - 1 = 0",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">6x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">+ x - 1 = 0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "x 2 + 6x - 1 = 0",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">+ 6x - 1 = 0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "x 2 + x - 6 = 0",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">+ x - 6 = 0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "6x 2 + x + 6 = 0",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">6x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">+&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">x + 6 = 0</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><b>Given:</b></p>\n\n<p>The quadratic equation&nbsp;<span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- x - 6 = 0.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Concept Used:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>The general form of quadratic equation x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- (p + q)x + pq&nbsp;= 0</p>\n\n<p>Sum of roots = p + q</p>\n\n<p>Product of roots = pq</p>\n\n<p>Where p &amp; q are roots of quadratic equation,</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">The quadratic equation&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- x - 6 = 0</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">x<sup>2</sup></span>&nbsp;- 3x + 2x - 6 = 0</p>\n\n<p>x(x - 3) + 2(x - 3) = 0</p>\n\n<p>(x - 3) (x + 2) = 0</p>\n\n<p>x = 3, -2</p>\n\n<p>Reciprocal of roots = 1/3, -1/2</p>\n\n<p>Sum of roots = 1/3 + (-1/2) = -1/6</p>\n\n<p>Product of roots = -1/6</p>\n\n<p>&there4;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">The equation where roots are reciprocal of the roots&nbsp;</span>is x<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>-(-1/6)x -1/6 = 0</p>\n<strong>&rArr; 6x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ x - 1 = 0</strong>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0e1ff847ec10-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If x 8 - 32 x 4 + 256 = 0, then the positive value of \\(\\rm \\left(x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\right)\\) is :",
      "questionHtml": "If x<sup>8</sup>&nbsp;- 32 x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;+ 256 = 0, then the positive value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\left(x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\right)\\)</span>&nbsp;is :",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2.25",
          "html": "2.25&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5.75",
          "html": "5.75"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3.75",
          "html": "3.75&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4.25",
          "html": "4.25"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>GIVEN:</strong></p>\n\n<p>x<sup>8</sup>&nbsp;- 32x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;+ 256 = 0&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>CALCULATION:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Here, we have&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>x<sup>8</sup>&nbsp;- 32x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;+ 256 = 0&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x<sup>8</sup>&nbsp;- 16x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;-16x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;+ 256 = 0&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;( x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;- 16) - 16 (x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;- 16) = 0&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ( x<sup>4</sup>-16) (x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;- 16) = 0&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;= 16&nbsp;&nbsp;&hArr; x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 4&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Now, (x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 1/x<sup>2</sup>) = ( 4 + 1/4) = 4.25</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hence, the required value is 4.25 .</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0e1ff847ec10-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If the roots of the equation x 2 - 2ax + a 2 + a - 3 = 0 are real and less than 3, then which one of the following is correct?",
      "questionHtml": "If the roots of the equation x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 2ax + a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ a - 3 = 0 are real and less than 3, then which one of the following is correct?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "a < 2",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">a &lt; 2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2 < a < 3",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">2 &lt; a &lt; 3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3 < a < 4",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">3 &lt; a &lt; 4</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "a > 4",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">a &gt; 4</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> - 2ax + a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + a - 3 = 0 ....(1) ⇒ (x - a)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 3 - a</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Since, (x - a)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> ≥ 0 ⇒ 3 - a ≥ 0 ⇒ a ≤ 3</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The roots of the equation (1) is ⇒ x = <span class=\"math-tex\">\\({-(-2 \\pm √{(-2a)^2-4.1.(a^2+a-3)} \\over 2.1}\\)</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ x = a ± √(3 - a)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Since, roots are less than 3</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ a + √(3 - a) < 3 ⇒ √(3 - a) < 3 - a ⇒ 3 - a < 9 + a<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> - 6a ⇒ a<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> - 5a + 6 > 0 ⇒ (a - 2)(a - 3) > 0 ⇒ a < 2 or a > 3</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0e1ff847ec10-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If &alpha; and &beta; are the zeroes of a quadratic polynomial x 2 - 3x + 7, then the quadratic polynomial whose zeroes are \\(\\frac{1}{α}\\) and \\(\\frac{1}{β}\\) is",
      "questionHtml": "If &alpha; and &beta;&nbsp; are the zeroes of a quadratic polynomial x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 3x + 7, then the quadratic polynomial whose zeroes are&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{α}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{β}\\)</span> is",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "x 2 - 3x + 7",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">- 3x + 7</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "7x 2 - 3x - 1",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">7x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">- 3x - 1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "7x 2 + 3x + 1",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">7x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">+ 3x + 1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "7x 2 - 3x + 1",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">7x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">- 3x + 1</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&alpha; and &beta;&nbsp; are the zeroes of a quadratic polynomial x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- 3x + 7</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Concept used:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>If ax<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ bx + c = 0 be a quadratic equation, then&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Sum of roots = -b/a</p>\n\n<p>Product of roots = c/a</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Here,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- 3x + 7&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Sum of roots&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"\">&alpha; +&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&beta;</span><span style=\"\">)</span><span style=\"\">= -(-3)/1 = 3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Product of roots&nbsp;&alpha;</span><span style=\"\">&beta;&nbsp; = 7/1 = 7</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&there4; If the quadratic polynomial whose zeroes are&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{α}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{β}\\)</span>, then</p>\n\n<p>Sum of roots =&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{α}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\" style=\"outline: yellow solid 2px; cursor: default; ;;;;;\">\\(\\frac{1}{β}\\)</span><span style=\"\">, = (</span>&alpha; +&nbsp;&beta;)/<span style=\"\">&alpha;</span><span style=\"\">&beta; = 3/7</span></p>\n\n<p>Product of roots =&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{α}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\" style=\"outline: yellow solid 2px; cursor: default; ;;;;\">\\(\\frac{1}{β}\\)</span>&nbsp;= 1/<span style=\"\">&alpha;</span><span style=\"\">&beta; = 1/7</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&there4; The quadratic equation is x<sup>2&nbsp;</sup></span>- (3/7)x + 1/7 = 0</p>\n\n<p><strong>&rArr; 7x<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>- 3x + 1 = 0</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
