      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> x + 1/x = 15 </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">⇒ x</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size: 10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> + 1/x</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size: 10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> = 15</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size: 10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> - 2 </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">⇒ x</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size: 10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> + 1/x</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size: 10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> = 223.</span></p>\n\n<p>x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">4 </span>- 223x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 6 ⇒ x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">4 </span>- (x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1/x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>) × x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 6 ⇒ x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">4 </span>- x<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">4</span> - 1 + 6 ⇒ 5</p>\n",
