      "question": "If the factors of the quadratic equation x 2 + 4&radic;2x + 6 = 0 are (x + a&radic;2) and (x + b&radic;2) then find the value of a 2 + ab + b 2",
      "questionHtml": "If the factors of the quadratic equation&nbsp;x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 4&radic;2x + 6 = 0 are&nbsp;(x + a&radic;2) and (x + b&radic;2) then find the value of a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ ab + b<sup>2</sup>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "11",
          "html": "11"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "12",
          "html": "12"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "13",
          "html": "13"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p> <span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\"> + 4√2x + 6</span> = 0 ⇒ (x + √2) (x + 3√2) = 0 </p>\n\n<p>Comparing with <span style=\"\">(x + a√2) and (x + b√2)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">value of a = 1 and b = 3 or a = 3 and b = 1</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Now, a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\"> + ab + b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = <span style=\"\">1</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\"> + 1 × 3 + 3</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\"> or 3</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\"> + </span><span style=\"\">1 × 3 </span><span style=\"\">+ 1</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = 13</p>\n",
