      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(x+\\frac{1}{x}=3\\)</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(x+\\frac{1}{x}=3\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{x^2+1}{x}\\)</span>&nbsp;= 3</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 1 = 3x&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;x</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;- 3x&nbsp;+ 1 = 0</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">We know that,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Quadratic Equation, ax<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ bx + c = 0</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">x =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{{2a}}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">x =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{-(-3) \\pm \\sqrt{3^2-4\\times 1\\times 1}}{{2\\times1}}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;x =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{3 \\pm \\sqrt{5}}{{2}}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&there4; x =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{3+\\sqrt{5}}{{2}}\\)</span>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{3-\\sqrt{5}}{{2}}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;&nbsp;Option (3) is the correct answer.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n",
