      "solution": "<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> – 6x + 8 = 0 </p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 106, 124); --darkreader-inline-color: #a29a8e;\">αβ = c/a = 8, and α + β = -b/a = 6</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 106, 124); --darkreader-inline-color: #a29a8e;\">α<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>/β + β<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>/α = (α<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> + β<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>)/αβ ⇒ [(α + β)<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> - 3αβ(α + β)]/αβ ⇒ [6<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> - 3 × 8 × 6]/8 ⇒ ​72/8 = 9 </p>\n",
