      "question": "If \\(\\mathbf{x}+\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)=\\frac{(\\sqrt{3}+1)}{2}\\) then what is the value of x 4 + \\( \\left(\\frac{1}{x^4}\\right)\\) ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p><span style=\"\">If&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\mathbf{x}+\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)=\\frac{(\\sqrt{3}+1)}{2}\\)</span>&nbsp;then what is the value of x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">4</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\( \\left(\\frac{1}{x^4}\\right)\\)</span>?</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{(4 \\sqrt{3}-1)}{4}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(4 \\sqrt{3}-1)}{4}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{(4 \\sqrt{3}+1)}{4}\\)",
